WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
Alright, let me tell the people at home

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:04.010
what's going on, okay?

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.370
We are taping here at the Largo Theater,

00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:08.940
the historic Largo Theater,

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.450
in La Cieniga Boulevard,

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:13.510
in Los Angeles, West Hollywood.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.540
And, you know, we come to this theater

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:18.160
because we thought
theaters are in trouble,

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.570
let's revive a theater,

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:20.690
let's keep it going.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.500
Seemed like a nice thing to do.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.333
[Andy] Right.
Right?

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:24.460
What happens?

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.380
We get here this morning,

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:30.360
and we find out that someone
broke in to our little theater

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.290
and took some of our equipment!

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:36.440
Some of the equipment
we use to make the show.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:38.540
We got robbed, Andy!

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:40.170
Robbed!

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:41.420
Who would've thought?

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:42.780
[Conan] Yeah.
You would have thought

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:43.950
that the minute they came in

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.320
and saw Conan on anything,

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:46.807
they would've been like

00:00:46.807 --> 00:00:48.267
"no, c'mon,

00:00:48.267 --> 00:00:50.280
"he's one of the good guys."

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.430
[Conan] Yes.
Let's go break into

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.574
someone else's spot, yeah.

00:00:53.574 --> 00:00:54.860
Yeah, and whoever broke in here

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:59.860
had to stare what I think is
about 350 cardboard cutouts

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:03.640
of exuberant fans in the eyes

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:05.137
and say, "hey,

00:01:05.137 --> 00:01:07.720
"don't mind me, I'm
gonna steal some shit."

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:11.190
Wow, imagine if the robber was still here.

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:13.390
[Conan] Yeah.
Just sitting here quietly

00:01:14.708 --> 00:01:16.791
in all the cutouts, oops.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:19.050
The robber probably,

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:22.141
we probably walked in
and the robber just went-

00:01:22.141 --> 00:01:24.210
(laughter)

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:25.900
Robber's here somewhere,
I don't know who it is.

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.200
I wanna ask our field producer.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.940
He's been with me almost since day one,

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:32.340
and he holds the show together,

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:34.620
Jason Chillemi, I call him Chills

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:36.850
or Chilly Willy, as he prefers.

00:01:36.850 --> 00:01:40.550
Jason, what did they take exactly?

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:42.050
They got a couple of laptops.

00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:43.083
Laptops?

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:46.130
I mean, they took our laptops.

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:47.810
That's just the lowest.

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:48.643
What's that?

00:01:48.643 --> 00:01:49.476
It's how we do our interviews.

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:50.309
That's how we do the interviews.

00:01:50.309 --> 00:01:51.360
We do the interviews on Zoom.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:54.090
They ripped off our laptops!

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:56.370
What else did they take?
They took our slate.

00:01:56.370 --> 00:02:00.000
Okay, whenever we make a show,

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.410
Jason steps in and does a slate.

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:04.070
This thing, you've seen it all the time.

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:05.770
It's been around since
the beginning of movies

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:07.060
where they go "and."

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:08.850
You know, "here we go."

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:10.630
They took that!

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.310
That's the lowest!

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:16.470
I can't think of anything lower.

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:18.080
Okay, the laptops fine,

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:19.680
you took the slate?

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.570
Yeah I know.

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:22.340
That's crazy.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:24.340
No, you know what I was thinking about?

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:25.470
Look at us!

00:02:25.470 --> 00:02:27.500
What happened to us?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.850
This kind of shit isn't happening

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:31.330
to other big time late night shows.

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.230
No one breaks in to the Tonight Show

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:35.400
and steals all the equipment.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.500
What happened to us?

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:41.610
We've become this garage
band that drives around.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:44.520
We got our van, and we parked in an alley

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:47.030
and someone broke in and took our amps!

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:49.344
[Andy] Right.
What is that?

00:02:49.344 --> 00:02:53.150
This doesn't happen to
the other talk show hosts.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:56.250
This would never happen
to Kimmel or Fallon

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.490
or any of those guys.

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:58.497
No one breaks in,

00:02:58.497 --> 00:02:59.330
"what happened?"

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.827
"We couldn't do a show today."

00:03:00.827 --> 00:03:01.660
"What happened?"

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.757
"They broke in and took our shit, man.

00:03:04.757 --> 00:03:07.581
"They took our shit
while we were sleeping."

00:03:07.581 --> 00:03:09.960
(laughter)

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:13.240
What kind of new low is this for us?

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:14.700
And then who do I have to bitch,

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.000
what's our security?

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.441
Our security is a bunch of photographs.

00:03:18.441 --> 00:03:22.920
(laughter) Cardboard photographs of fans

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:24.750
from across the country.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:27.280
Jason, you've been with
me for like 27 years.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:28.910
You gotta admit this is a new low.

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:29.888
It is a new low.

00:03:29.888 --> 00:03:32.138
(laughter)

00:03:35.587 --> 00:03:39.690
"Hey man, there's gonna
be no Late Show tonight,"

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:40.523
says Colbert.

00:03:40.523 --> 00:03:41.547
"No Late Show tonight."

00:03:41.547 --> 00:03:42.380
"What happened?"

00:03:42.380 --> 00:03:43.867
"They broke in to the Ed Sullivan,

00:03:43.867 --> 00:03:45.737
"they stole our shit, man."

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:49.543
They stole my desk.
(laughter)

00:03:51.982 --> 00:03:53.120
I'm sorry.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.564
I'm sorry, whoever you are-

00:03:54.564 --> 00:03:56.350
(laughter)

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.210
Man, just for the laugh alone,

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.120
maybe it's worth it.

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:00.260
Right right.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:01.790
Enjoy the laptops.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:04.360
Yeah, what's the robber
gonna do with this thing?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.388
[Andy] I don't know.

00:04:05.388 --> 00:04:06.490
What?

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:07.807
And he probably was like,

00:04:07.807 --> 00:04:10.090
"and that's a robbery!" Clack!

00:04:10.090 --> 00:04:13.880
And it wasn't like a battery
one that was like synced.

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.100
It was just like wood.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.110
Yes, it's what kids use.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:20.900
It's what 16 year olds use
to make a student film.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.210
Or that you can go buy
on Hollywood Boulevard.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:24.043
You can buy them.

00:04:24.043 --> 00:04:26.310
Probably in Hollywood,
they're on the street.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:29.400
They're everywhere, and he took it!

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.893
It's ridiculous!

00:04:31.848 --> 00:04:34.720
I think we got ours at a souvenir shop.

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.800
Suddenly this show that I've
been working on for 27 years

00:04:38.993 --> 00:04:40.914
is a Nissan Sentra.

00:04:40.914 --> 00:04:44.890
(laughter) It's a 1995 Nissan Sentra.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.900
They took the air conditioning right out.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:49.570
I put a blanket over the stuff.

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:51.320
I didn't think anyone would notice.

